5/06/GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-6-1024x1024.webp\"\n    data-title=\"GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-6\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/768;\">\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-8\"\n   data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-8-768x768.webp\"\n    data-image=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-8-1024x1024.webp\"\n    data-title=\"GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-8\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/768;\">\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-9\"\n   data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-9-768x768.webp\"\n    data-image=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-9-1024x1024.webp\"\n    data-title=\"GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-9\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/768;\">\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-5\"\n   data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-5-768x768.webp\"\n    data-image=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-5-1024x1024.webp\"\n    data-title=\"GK370AFTSDZM1GK370AFTVCZM1GK370AFTSDYM1GK370AFTVCYM1-5\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/768;\">\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- end Compact Gallery -->\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ad1858 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3ad1858\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fca8d6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3fca8d6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a01766a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a01766a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"539\">A battery-powered mobile refrigerated box offers an efficient and flexible solution for professional transport needs. Thanks to its integrated battery, the <strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"175\">KOALA GREEN 140</strong> provides autonomous operation without the need for continuous external power. The battery can be easily recharged by connecting the unit to a 230Vac power supply or by removing it from the cooling module and using a dedicated external charger. Its stackable design makes the KOALA GREEN 140 practical and ideal for space optimization during transport and storage.</p><ul data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"995\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><li data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"569\"><p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"569\"><strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"555\">Capacity</strong>: 135 liters</p></li><li data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"629\"><p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"629\"><strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"584\">Material</strong>: Robust and highly insulating polyethylene</p></li><li data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"701\"><p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"701\"><strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"646\">Insulation</strong>: Eco-friendly polyurethane foam (CFC- and HCFC-free)</p></li><li data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"765\"><p data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"765\"><strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"731\">Autonomous power supply</strong>: Via 230Vac or external charger</p></li><li data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"840\"><p data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"840\"><strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"785\">Certification</strong>: ATP-certified for the transport of perishable goods</p></li><li data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"909\"><p data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"909\"><strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"863\">Practical design</strong>: Front-opening door for easy product access</p></li><li data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"995\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"995\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"928\">Stackability</strong>: Structure designed to optimize space during transport and storage</p></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f8b84b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5f8b84b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b80f4fb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b80f4fb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9fc7267 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9fc7267\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/haccp2.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2874 lazyload\" alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 100px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 100/100;\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57b5a8b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"57b5a8b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/riciclo2.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2875 lazyload\" alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 100px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 100/100;\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54c0076 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"54c0076\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-32056d2 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"32056d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/KOALA_GREEN_370_contenitore_refrigerato_rev3-en.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Data sheet</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div